description:
Carmarthenshire County Council, on behalf of the West Wales Nutrient Management Board, requires a Substance Flow Analysis to be undertaken of sector nitrogen use in the food system of the Eastern Cleddau and Western Cleddau catchments. The Council also requires: 
• An investigation into the links between sector nitrogen use and river nitrogen flux and concentrations; 
• Update of the existing Substance Flow Analysis for phosphorus in the the Western and Eastern Cleddau catchments based on furthe
